#tr.en: I, the woman, did not water the tree as it was in(?) my hand 
9'. [...] bi2#-in#-du11# 
#tr.en: It was by means of my foot that I watered it 
10'. [...]-u3#-de3-en bi2#-[...] 
#tr.en: I said “When am I to sit on its flowering throne?” 
11'. [...]-nu2#-de3#?-en bi2#-[...] 
